---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Layout title="Support DrakeLabs" description="Optional support for DrakeLabs guides, project notes, and future experiments.">
  <section class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">SUPPORT DRAKELABS</p><h1>Help keep<br /><em>the notes coming.</em></h1><p class="lead">If you’ve found the DrakeLabs guides or project notes useful, you’re welcome to support the work. Everything shared here remains freely available, and support is entirely optional.</p></section>
  <section class="section two-col" aria-labelledby="support-purpose"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHAT SUPPORT HELPS WITH</p><h2 id="support-purpose">A little goes back<br />into the project.</h2><p>Contributions help with the domain, documentation, and future experiments: trying ideas, recording what works, and turning lessons into something another reader can use.</p><p>The project still starts with what I have. Support helps it grow while keeping the guides and notes accessible to everyone.</p></div><div class="manifesto support-panel"><span>OPTIONAL CONTRIBUTIONS</span><h3>Support through PayPal.</h3><p>If you’d like to contribute, continue to PayPal and choose an amount that works for you.</p><a class="button" href="https://paypal.me/zachdrake" aria-describedby="support-status">Support via PayPal <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="caption" id="support-status">Opens PayPal’s website. You can review the recipient and payment details there before sending anything.</p></div></section>
  <section class="note-strip"><p class="eyebrow">THANK YOU FOR BEING HERE</p><h2>Reading is support, too.</h2><p>Explore the notes, try an idea, or share a guide with someone who might find it useful. You don’t need to contribute money to be part of the learning.</p><p class="caption">Contributions support the project’s documentation and experiments. They don’t purchase media access, services, or priority support.</p><div class="actions"><a class="text-link" href={`${base}journal/`}>Read the field notes →</a><a class="text-link" href={`${base}projects/`}>Explore the projects →</a></div></section>
</Layout>
